    "## 6. Model Architecture\n",
    "\n",
    "### 6.1 Convolutional Encoder\n",
    "\n",
    "**Architecture Design:**\n",
    "\n",
    "The embedding network follows a standard convolutional architecture:\n",
    "\n",
    "| Layer | Output Channels | Kernel | Output Size |\n",
    "|-------|----------------|--------|-------------|\n",
    "| Conv1 + BN + ReLU + Pool | 32 | 3×3 | 64×64 |\n",
    "| Conv2 + BN + ReLU + Pool | 64 | 3×3 | 32×32 |\n",
    "| Conv3 + BN + ReLU + Pool | 128 | 3×3 | 16×16 |\n",
    "| Adaptive Avg Pool | 128 | - | 1×1 |\n",
    "| FC | 128 | - | 128 |\n",
    "\n",
    "**Design Rationale:**\n",
    "- Batch normalization stabilizes training\n",
    "- Max pooling provides spatial invariance\n",
    "- Adaptive pooling handles variable input sizes\n",
    "- Final embedding dimension of 128 balances expressiveness and computation"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "code",
   "execution_count": null,
