    "## 7. Evaluation Metrics\n",
    "\n",
    "### 7.1 Mathematical Formulations\n",
    "\n",
    "**Accuracy:**\n",
    "$$\\text{Accuracy} = \\frac{\\text{TP} + \\text{TN}}{\\text{TP} + \\text{TN} + \\text{FP} + \\text{FN}} = \\frac{\\text{Correct predictions}}{\\text{Total predictions}}$$\n",
    "\n",
    "**F1-Score (Macro):**\n",
    "$$F1_{\\text{macro}} = \\frac{1}{C} \\sum_{c=1}^{C} F1_c$$\n",
    "\n",
    "where $F1_c = \\frac{2 \\cdot \\text{Precision}_c \\cdot \\text{Recall}_c}{\\text{Precision}_c + \\text{Recall}_c}$\n",
    "\n",
    "**Expected Calibration Error (ECE):**\n",
    "$$ECE = \\sum_{b=1}^{B} \\frac{|B_b|}{n} |\\text{acc}(B_b) - \\text{conf}(B_b)|$$\n",
    "\n",
    "where $B_b$ is the $b$-th bin of confidence scores, $\\text{acc}(B_b)$ is the accuracy in that bin, and $\\text{conf}(B_b)$ is the average confidence.\n",
    "\n",
    "**Attribution Sparsity:**\n",
    "$$Sparsity = \\frac{1}{H \\cdot W} \\sum_{i,j} \\mathbb{1}(|a_{ij}| < \\tau)$$\n",
    "\n",
    "where $\\tau = 0.6$ is the sparsity threshold."
   ]
